1
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:05,250
[LARA] Prince.

2
00:00:06,630 --> 00:00:07,720
Prince...

3
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:11,090
[hums]

4
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:14,970
Is this one really the prince?

5
00:00:15,430 --> 00:00:16,600
Did you say something?

6
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:19,480
I need to know as much as I can
about the prince.

7
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:20,690
About the prince?

8
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:23,230
What do you mean, the prince?

9
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:24,320
[sighs]

10
00:00:25,570 --> 00:00:29,400
Something like crystal clear
eyes that draw you in.

11
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:31,280
So, when you say the prince,

12
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,410
do you mean dark eyes
like a tall beast?

13
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:35,580
Beautiful silky hair
blowing in the wind?

14
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:37,290
A big muscular body.

15
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,080
Stop talking about me.

16
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,630
[sighs] Tests...

17
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:51,510
[LARA] I wonder what a prince
is really like now.

18
00:00:59,390 --> 00:01:01,480
[♪ opening music begins]

19
00:02:26,350 --> 00:02:28,480
[♪ opening music ends]

20
00:02:30,190 --> 00:02:32,440
It has now been 3 whole weeks
since I came back

21
00:02:32,490 --> 00:02:34,610
to the human world
and arrived in this town.

22
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:37,410
But yet, after all this time,

23
00:02:37,780 --> 00:02:39,870
I still haven't been able
to find true love.

24
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:44,250
You've been glued to that
television day in and day out.

25
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,420
What on earth are you doing?

26
00:02:46,460 --> 00:02:48,920
I'm learning everything about
the real world.

27
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,250
Oh, forget about that.

28
00:02:50,290 --> 00:02:52,380
Go out there
and find true love already.

29
00:02:52,420 --> 00:02:54,510
Well, yes,
I'd love to do that as well.

30
00:02:54,930 --> 00:02:56,680
-Although...
-Although?

31
00:02:57,470 --> 00:02:59,350
Mari, can you take me
to school today?

32
00:02:59,390 --> 00:03:00,220
No way.

33
00:03:01,060 --> 00:03:03,140
Mari, can you take me
to school today?

34
00:03:03,180 --> 00:03:04,180
No chance.

35
00:03:04,980 --> 00:03:07,440
-Mari, take me to school.
-No way.

36
00:03:08,190 --> 00:03:10,480
[LARA] School...?

37
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:13,530
[WITCH] So, you haven't done
anything at all?

38
00:03:13,570 --> 00:03:16,070
-It's because Mari...
-Why school?

39
00:03:16,110 --> 00:03:18,490
-Why is it so important?
-It's the only place I know

40
00:03:18,530 --> 00:03:20,530
where there are
lots of people gathering.

41
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:27,080
If I take you,
will you keep quiet?

42
00:03:27,210 --> 00:03:28,580
Yes, of course!

43
00:03:28,630 --> 00:03:30,540
All right,
but this is a one-time thing.

44
00:03:30,790 --> 00:03:31,670
Okay.

45
00:03:32,460 --> 00:03:33,460
Oh, wow!

46
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,130
It's time!

47
00:03:35,590 --> 00:03:37,680
I'm finally going
to find my prince!

48
00:03:41,430 --> 00:03:42,390
[WITCH] Lara...

49
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:46,270
Don't say anything you shouldn't
while you're out there.

50
00:03:46,310 --> 00:03:47,390
Leave it to me.

51
00:03:47,770 --> 00:03:51,110
-Make sure you act like a human.
-Leave it to me.

52
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:54,190
You mustn't say anything
about me or your situation.

53
00:03:54,230 --> 00:03:56,570
Do you understand?
Not unless you want your tongue

54
00:03:56,610 --> 00:03:58,860
cut out again like last time,
you hear?

55
00:03:58,910 --> 00:03:59,740
[gasps]

56
00:04:02,830 --> 00:04:03,660
[whimpers]

57
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:06,500
[MARI] We've gotta go.

58
00:04:08,210 --> 00:04:10,460
It's been three weeks
since Lara moved in.

59
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:12,290
School, school, school.

60
00:04:12,340 --> 00:04:13,590
It's all she asks about.

61
00:04:14,290 --> 00:04:17,010
But it's exam season and there
aren't any clubs, so it's fine.

62
00:04:17,590 --> 00:04:19,130
At least that's what I thought.

63
00:04:20,130 --> 00:04:22,050
I regretted my decision
straight away.

64
00:04:23,300 --> 00:04:26,020
Why did I think it was a good
idea to take her to school?

65
00:04:27,390 --> 00:04:29,980
Do you think
there is a prince out there

66
00:04:30,020 --> 00:04:32,860
who loves me and will make
everything back to normal again?

67
00:04:32,900 --> 00:04:35,230
-I don't know.
-I have to find it though.

68
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,740
I have to find true love.

69
00:04:37,190 --> 00:04:38,240
Knock it off.

70
00:04:38,780 --> 00:04:41,360
I guess the question is,
what even is true love anyway?

71
00:04:41,870 --> 00:04:42,660
Do you know, Mari?

72
00:04:43,820 --> 00:04:46,160
If you say another word,
I'm leaving you behind.

73
00:04:46,200 --> 00:04:47,160
But why?

74
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,540
Anyway,
regardless of what it is,

75
00:04:49,580 --> 00:04:51,460
it's my destiny
to find true love.

76
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:53,210
[MARI] Shut up.

77
00:04:53,250 --> 00:04:54,590
As if I care
about something like that.

78
00:04:54,630 --> 00:04:55,840
Something like that?

79
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:57,460
I just don't want
to hear about it.

80
00:04:57,500 --> 00:04:59,050
I don't even understand it.

81
00:05:00,470 --> 00:05:02,180
Oh, there it is again.

82
00:05:02,550 --> 00:05:04,350
There, can't you see that?

83
00:05:04,390 --> 00:05:06,470
How many times
do I have to tell you?

84
00:05:07,270 --> 00:05:10,310
-Well, that's weird.
-You're the one who's weird.

85
00:05:14,900 --> 00:05:16,110
[LARA] It's school!

86
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:20,240
At last, the search
for my prince is about to begin!

87
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:21,570
-[grunts]
-Oh!

88
00:05:28,290 --> 00:05:31,500
Hey, Mari,
where are you taking me to?

89
00:05:34,710 --> 00:05:37,550
I have to go and find my prince.
He's here somewhere.

90
00:05:44,430 --> 00:05:45,430
[gasps]

91
00:05:46,050 --> 00:05:48,180
[♪ upbeat music]

92
00:05:52,390 --> 00:05:53,440
[gasps]

93
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:57,690
[♪ music continues]

94
00:05:58,270 --> 00:05:59,360
[thud]

95
00:06:01,570 --> 00:06:03,450
[MARI] The exam
will be over by noon,

96
00:06:03,490 --> 00:06:05,120
so wait here until then.

97
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:09,080
What's an exam?

98
00:06:10,910 --> 00:06:12,330
Cross this line
and you're banned

99
00:06:12,370 --> 00:06:13,710
from watching TV for life.

100
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:14,880
For life?

101
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:15,750
[door slams]

102
00:06:17,580 --> 00:06:21,300
-[FEMALE] Lara?
-[MALE] Yes, I found her.

103
00:06:22,300 --> 00:06:23,340
That's a relief.

104
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:34,100
So where is she?
Is Lara okay?

105
00:06:35,230 --> 00:06:39,440
[MALE] Well, Lady Lara's fine,
but she has human legs.

106
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,480
[gasps]

107
00:06:45,450 --> 00:06:46,490
That witch.

108
00:06:47,990 --> 00:06:48,990
[sighs]

109
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:52,120
I wonder how much longer
I have to stay here.

110
00:06:52,370 --> 00:06:53,790
-[YOSHIYA] Aw, man.
-Huh?

111
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:57,710
Oh, Yoshiya!

112
00:06:58,250 --> 00:07:00,050
Lara?
What are you doing here?

113
00:07:00,550 --> 00:07:03,380
-What's with the uniform?
-I'm waiting here for Mari.

114
00:07:03,420 --> 00:07:05,720
Shouldn't you be studying
for that exam as well?

115
00:07:06,590 --> 00:07:08,350
Ah, whatever. I don't care.

116
00:07:08,890 --> 00:07:10,930
I'll never gonna leave
this town.

117
00:07:11,260 --> 00:07:13,020
You know what you want,
don't you?

118
00:07:13,060 --> 00:07:15,140
-Yeah, that's right.
-That's wonderful.

119
00:07:15,190 --> 00:07:16,190
Why?

120
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:18,610
Because it means
you have conviction.

121
00:07:18,650 --> 00:07:20,060
I think that's wonderful.

122
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,520
Uh...

123
00:07:22,940 --> 00:07:23,900
Uh...

124
00:07:24,690 --> 00:07:26,650
Anyway,
what are you doing here again?

125
00:07:27,450 --> 00:07:29,490
I wanted to come here
so I could find a prince.

126
00:07:30,070 --> 00:07:32,490
A prince, huh?
You mean a boyfriend?

127
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:34,500
You can leave it to me.

128
00:07:34,830 --> 00:07:37,040
I'll introduce you to some
guys from school.

129
00:07:37,330 --> 00:07:38,460
[laughs]

130
00:07:41,130 --> 00:07:42,920
Hey, is the test over already?

131
00:07:43,630 --> 00:07:46,760
Yoshiya, the teacher
was looking for you earlier.

132
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:50,010
-Wait a minute, who's that girl?
-Don't worry about that.

133
00:07:50,470 --> 00:07:53,260
I wanna know, who do you think
is the prince of our school?

134
00:07:53,310 --> 00:07:54,430
The prince of our school?

135
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:56,980
Yeah, it's fine if it's me.

136
00:07:57,350 --> 00:07:58,810
[girl sighs]

137
00:07:58,850 --> 00:08:00,940
I can't think of anyone,
not at this school.

138
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:04,320
-[GIRL 1] What about this?
-[YOSHIYA] An idol?

139
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:07,950
-[GIRL 2] This one is my prince.
-[YOSHIYA] A comedian?

140
00:08:08,490 --> 00:08:10,870
-[GIRL 3] This one is mine.
-[YOSHIYA] A VTuber?

141
00:08:11,450 --> 00:08:13,950
There's no way you can
actually date any of them.

142
00:08:13,990 --> 00:08:16,200
I just like to admire
my favorite idol.

143
00:08:16,250 --> 00:08:18,540
It's not always about
going on dates.

144
00:08:19,250 --> 00:08:21,460
Yeah, I don't wanna risk
fighting or being betrayed.

145
00:08:21,500 --> 00:08:23,750
But it doesn't beat
the real thing though.

146
00:08:24,550 --> 00:08:26,960
Who do you think
is the most popular at school?

147
00:08:27,010 --> 00:08:28,380
It's fine if it's me.

148
00:08:29,430 --> 00:08:31,470
Isn't the most popular guy
Ouji Moriyama?

149
00:08:31,510 --> 00:08:32,510
Ouji?!

150
00:08:33,300 --> 00:08:35,930
Yeah, but I think Ouji
is already seeing Himeka.

151
00:08:35,970 --> 00:08:38,390
-Hime!
-Oh, that's them over there.

152
00:08:38,430 --> 00:08:39,480
[gasps]

153
00:08:45,230 --> 00:08:46,610
[LARA] The prince and the...

154
00:08:47,820 --> 00:08:48,650
...princess.

155
00:08:50,030 --> 00:08:51,610
-Huh?
-Oh, hey, Otsu!

156
00:08:51,660 --> 00:08:53,910
-I've been looking for you.
-See you later.

157
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,200
Okay, bye.

158
00:08:55,410 --> 00:08:56,620
-[LARA] Um...
-Huh?

159
00:08:58,080 --> 00:09:00,620
-Can I help you?
-I wonder...

160
00:09:01,670 --> 00:09:03,920
can you tell me
how you met your prince?

161
00:09:04,750 --> 00:09:07,340
His name is Ouji Moriyama.
He's not a real prince,

162
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:09,380
but he does act
like royalty sometimes.

163
00:09:10,050 --> 00:09:12,890
I don't mind.
My name is Himeka Maibara.

164
00:09:13,140 --> 00:09:14,260
So cool!

165
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:16,470
I can't believe
that you two met.

166
00:09:17,430 --> 00:09:19,930
I was born on the same day
at the same hospital as Ouji.

167
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:22,520
Our families
have always been really close

168
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:24,150
and looked out for each other.

169
00:09:24,940 --> 00:09:26,730
-Oh...
-That makes total sense.

170
00:09:27,230 --> 00:09:29,400
-It was fate, wasn't it?
-Not at all.

171
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:32,610
Do you have more things in
common with each other?

172
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:34,450
Mm...

173
00:09:34,490 --> 00:09:37,540
Oh, we do have matching moles
on our arms.

174
00:09:37,580 --> 00:09:38,500
It's right here.

175
00:09:41,250 --> 00:09:42,870
I don't have one on my arm,

176
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:45,170
so then that must mean
it's definitely fate!

177
00:09:45,210 --> 00:09:47,460
Yeah. You know,
you're really funny, Lara.

178
00:09:48,210 --> 00:09:50,380
So have you both already
exchanged engagement rings yet?

179
00:09:50,420 --> 00:09:51,470
[gasps]

180
00:09:52,170 --> 00:09:53,970
[laughs]
What are you talking about?

181
00:09:54,260 --> 00:09:55,590
We're just childhood friends.

182
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:57,300
There's nothing romantic
about us.

183
00:09:57,760 --> 00:10:00,520
So, you mean to say
you both don't love each other?

184
00:10:04,020 --> 00:10:05,110
Oh!

185
00:10:09,650 --> 00:10:11,360
You two are so perfect together.

186
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:13,610
I just thought
you must be madly in love.

187
00:10:14,410 --> 00:10:16,160
I guess you could say
we are closer

188
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,530
than just regular friends.

189
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:20,370
He's been by my side
ever since we were little,

190
00:10:20,410 --> 00:10:22,370
and he's helped me out
quite a lot too.

191
00:10:22,910 --> 00:10:24,000
He helped you a lot?

192
00:10:24,500 --> 00:10:26,080
Well, it was nothing major,

193
00:10:26,130 --> 00:10:28,290
like eating the food
I couldn't finish myself,

194
00:10:28,340 --> 00:10:31,090
or when he would carry me
on his back when I hurt my leg.

195
00:10:31,470 --> 00:10:32,470
Stuff like that.

196
00:10:33,380 --> 00:10:35,550
[♪ gentle music]

197
00:10:38,430 --> 00:10:41,180
Your Highness, you really
shouldn't be doing that.

198
00:10:44,640 --> 00:10:45,690
Oh, I see.

199
00:10:46,190 --> 00:10:47,610
So you've fallen for him?

200
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:51,110
No way! Everyone's always
jumping to the conclusion

201
00:10:51,150 --> 00:10:53,650
that we're in love.
I'd be happy if we could just

202
00:10:53,690 --> 00:10:56,360
stay on good terms like this
as best friends forever.

203
00:10:56,650 --> 00:10:59,620
-Just like this forever?
-Sure.

204
00:10:59,660 --> 00:11:02,580
I'd be fine if things with Ouji
stayed exactly as they are now.

205
00:11:03,330 --> 00:11:05,250
-But that's impossible.
-Huh?

206
00:11:06,330 --> 00:11:08,290
[LARA] It's bound
to come to an end someday.

207
00:11:08,540 --> 00:11:09,590
I know.

208
00:11:12,590 --> 00:11:14,590
Lara, you're definitely
not a student

209
00:11:14,630 --> 00:11:16,050
at this school, are you?

210
00:11:16,090 --> 00:11:17,680
So who was it
who brought you here?

211
00:11:18,010 --> 00:11:20,350
-Huh?
-Oh, Mari!

212
00:11:21,140 --> 00:11:22,470
-No more TV!
-[gasps]

213
00:11:23,350 --> 00:11:25,100
But I got out
through the window!

214
00:11:25,140 --> 00:11:26,310
[MARI] Same difference.

215
00:11:28,150 --> 00:11:31,190
[HIME] Are you leaving already?
It'd be good to see you again.

216
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:33,110
I won't bring her here again.

217
00:11:33,530 --> 00:11:35,030
Mari, where do you live?

218
00:11:35,280 --> 00:11:37,240
-Ishiyama.
-Great, me too!

219
00:11:37,610 --> 00:11:39,030
We can all walk together.

220
00:11:39,450 --> 00:11:41,120
Hey, isn't that Ouji over there?

221
00:11:42,540 --> 00:11:44,450
Wow, Lara,
you've got good eyesight.

222
00:11:44,500 --> 00:11:47,040
Ouji said he was going home
with his friend but...

223
00:11:47,580 --> 00:11:50,290
I'm gonna walk home with him.
Bye, see you later.

224
00:11:56,220 --> 00:11:57,340
Lara, are you coming?

225
00:11:59,430 --> 00:12:01,140
-[OUJI] Shall we go?
-Yeah.

226
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:03,350
[laughing]

227
00:12:13,980 --> 00:12:14,940
What is this?

228
00:12:15,490 --> 00:12:17,150
It's so tasty! No way!

229
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:20,030
-How can I ever repay you?
-It's totally fine.

230
00:12:20,070 --> 00:12:22,490
-You don't need to do anything.
-Are you kidding?

231
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:25,290
I learned so much
from what you told me today.

232
00:12:25,700 --> 00:12:27,290
[HIME] Oh, like what exactly?

233
00:12:27,830 --> 00:12:30,170
[LARA] Well, you see,
I'm looking for my prince.

234
00:12:30,500 --> 00:12:31,460
[HIME] Your prince?

235
00:12:32,210 --> 00:12:33,670
Oh, but I don't mean
your prince.

236
00:12:34,170 --> 00:12:35,550
I'm looking for my soulmate,

237
00:12:36,340 --> 00:12:38,300
the one with whom
I can feel true love.

238
00:12:40,010 --> 00:12:41,180
But it's so difficult.

239
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:43,680
I mean, you and Ouji,
on the other hand,

240
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:46,470
you both look like you are
truly meant for each other.

241
00:12:47,020 --> 00:12:48,060
Hey, Himeka...

242
00:12:50,390 --> 00:12:53,520
-Oh...
-[Himeka sobs]

243
00:12:54,820 --> 00:12:58,610
So, Lara, the thing is,
I lied to you earlier today.

244
00:12:59,610 --> 00:13:03,320
I lied because I really do...
like Ouji.

245
00:13:03,490 --> 00:13:04,530
[gasps]

246
00:13:09,210 --> 00:13:11,500
It's impossible!
There's no way I can love you!

247
00:13:11,540 --> 00:13:12,630
No, wait!

248
00:13:13,420 --> 00:13:14,290
That's so lame.

249
00:13:15,380 --> 00:13:17,460
Some are loved by the prince
and it's wonderful,

250
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:19,510
and some aren't
and it's painful.

251
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:22,300
[crying]

252
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:26,600
It's not fair! Why should those
who are in love fight too?

253
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:28,180
Well, if you're that sensitive,

254
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:30,600
everything you watch
must be entertaining.

255
00:13:31,180 --> 00:13:32,890
[TV] I have no choice
but to go back.

256
00:13:33,520 --> 00:13:37,020
My 100 fiancées on my home
planet are waiting for me.

257
00:13:37,610 --> 00:13:40,780
[FEMALE] Even so, life without
you is no life at all.

258
00:13:41,610 --> 00:13:44,030
[MALE] I guess...
I love you!

259
00:13:44,070 --> 00:13:46,410
[crying]

260
00:13:53,540 --> 00:13:55,670
-[LARA] Mari.
-[MARI] What?

261
00:13:56,250 --> 00:13:58,880
Can I go to school with you
again tomorrow, please?

262
00:13:58,920 --> 00:13:59,670
[MARI] No way.

263
00:14:00,550 --> 00:14:03,050
-[LARA] Pretty please?
-[MARI] Pretty no.

264
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:04,640
Mari...

265
00:14:05,470 --> 00:14:06,510
[MARI] Hmm?

266
00:14:14,810 --> 00:14:19,480
Lara, if you take this potion,
you can become human.

267
00:14:20,570 --> 00:14:23,990
But before that,
I'm going to take your voice.

268
00:14:24,030 --> 00:14:24,950
My voice?

269
00:14:25,570 --> 00:14:28,240
The world above
is so very harsh and fragile.

270
00:14:28,280 --> 00:14:30,410
Just a single word
in the wrong place,

271
00:14:30,450 --> 00:14:33,080
and they will cast you out
without a second thought.

272
00:14:33,460 --> 00:14:35,380
Oh, don't worry.

273
00:14:35,420 --> 00:14:38,090
I'll give you your voice back
when the time comes.

274
00:14:38,130 --> 00:14:39,170
Someday.

275
00:14:39,500 --> 00:14:41,670
[♪ melancholic music]

276
00:14:44,510 --> 00:14:46,640
[indistinct chatter]

277
00:14:49,890 --> 00:14:50,720
Huh?

278
00:14:51,970 --> 00:14:52,810
Lara?

279
00:14:55,390 --> 00:14:57,190
If I admitted I liked Ouji,

280
00:14:57,650 --> 00:14:59,940
I feel like it would ruin
my friendship with him,

281
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:02,650
so I just ignore my feelings
and pretend.

282
00:15:03,700 --> 00:15:06,530
Although if our friendship
will end, then I'm going to wish

283
00:15:06,570 --> 00:15:08,870
that I'd just admitted it
to him sooner.

284
00:15:08,910 --> 00:15:10,080
Why not try now?

285
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:11,580
[sighs] It's impossible.

286
00:15:11,620 --> 00:15:14,330
Ouji and I will never end up
together in that way.

287
00:15:16,620 --> 00:15:21,500
Although sometimes you'll find
the impossible happens.

288
00:15:21,550 --> 00:15:23,550
[♪ gentle piano music]

289
00:15:24,010 --> 00:15:25,090
What's your name?

290
00:15:29,180 --> 00:15:30,220
[gasps]

291
00:15:32,390 --> 00:15:33,310
Quite strange...

292
00:15:34,480 --> 00:15:37,020
but I feel like we've met
each other before somewhere.

293
00:15:38,140 --> 00:15:39,360
Could this be fate?

294
00:15:41,570 --> 00:15:44,070
Your feelings must have
gotten through to him.

295
00:15:44,490 --> 00:15:45,450
[LARA] From then on,

296
00:15:46,070 --> 00:15:48,490
that person became
someone very special to me.

297
00:15:49,490 --> 00:15:51,200
Even without any words...

298
00:15:52,030 --> 00:15:53,490
we could understand each other.

299
00:15:54,450 --> 00:15:56,160
That's what I thought.

300
00:15:57,460 --> 00:15:58,710
That's what you thought?

301
00:16:05,550 --> 00:16:07,420
There's a reason
I came to see you today.

302
00:16:07,470 --> 00:16:09,970
I had something I really wanted
to say to you.

303
00:16:11,350 --> 00:16:13,930
I know this might be
none of my business,

304
00:16:13,970 --> 00:16:16,930
but I think
that you should tell Ouji

305
00:16:16,980 --> 00:16:18,690
exactly how you feel about him.

306
00:16:18,980 --> 00:16:20,020
[gasps]

307
00:16:20,400 --> 00:16:21,270
But why?

308
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:25,280
[LARA] I don't want you
to have any regrets because

309
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:28,570
I couldn't tell my prince one
thing I really wanted to say.

310
00:16:29,110 --> 00:16:30,320
Now it's too late.

311
00:16:31,370 --> 00:16:33,660
There is no way I can ever see
that person anymore.

312
00:16:34,950 --> 00:16:36,080
Although you still can.

313
00:16:36,620 --> 00:16:38,750
You can still see your prince.

314
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:47,170
I can't just tell him.

315
00:16:47,510 --> 00:16:48,550
There's no way.

316
00:16:51,340 --> 00:16:53,010
Are we done talking now?

317
00:16:53,930 --> 00:16:54,760
Mari!

318
00:16:57,270 --> 00:17:00,270
Look at you both.
Don't make those weird faces

319
00:17:00,310 --> 00:17:02,150
while sitting
in front of my club room.

320
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:04,400
-Huh?
-[MARI] It's bad luck.

321
00:17:04,940 --> 00:17:05,900
Mari...

322
00:17:06,570 --> 00:17:08,280
Club activities
start tomorrow and I-—

323
00:17:08,320 --> 00:17:10,030
[laughs]

324
00:17:15,330 --> 00:17:16,620
[HIME] I'm sorry, Lara.

325
00:17:17,290 --> 00:17:18,450
You were right all along.

326
00:17:19,370 --> 00:17:21,500
I guess I have to tell Ouji
after all.

327
00:17:24,080 --> 00:17:25,090
[OUJI] So...

328
00:17:27,380 --> 00:17:29,420
Himeka,
you're like family to me.

329
00:17:30,340 --> 00:17:31,510
You mean so much to me,

330
00:17:31,550 --> 00:17:33,640
even if I don't love you
romantically.

331
00:17:35,510 --> 00:17:37,100
I hope... you understand.

332
00:17:37,140 --> 00:17:39,980
[crying]

333
00:17:43,230 --> 00:17:47,360
[LARA] It's okay, go ahead
and cry your heart out.

334
00:17:48,190 --> 00:17:51,440
-You're the only one crying.
-[HIME] Lara, it's okay, really.

335
00:17:52,150 --> 00:17:53,360
In fact, it's amazing.

336
00:17:53,410 --> 00:17:55,030
I already feel so much better.

337
00:17:56,450 --> 00:17:57,450
[LARA] Better?

338
00:18:01,410 --> 00:18:04,670
It's because I know he's not
the only prince out there.

339
00:18:05,460 --> 00:18:06,500
[gasps]

340
00:18:08,300 --> 00:18:10,420
I really can't wait
to meet a new prince,

341
00:18:11,010 --> 00:18:12,670
and I will one day.

342
00:18:18,890 --> 00:18:21,100
I'm so glad
you came back to see me today.

343
00:18:21,890 --> 00:18:22,730
Thank you.

344
00:18:24,060 --> 00:18:25,940
And thank you
to your friend Mari.

345
00:18:25,980 --> 00:18:27,020
Hmm?

346
00:18:28,940 --> 00:18:30,440
You are friends, aren't you?

347
00:18:31,150 --> 00:18:33,320
[♪ gentle music]

348
00:18:43,250 --> 00:18:44,290
Mm-hmm.

349
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:49,420
[HIME] Oh, Lara, please come
and visit me anytime.

350
00:18:49,460 --> 00:18:51,130
[laughs]

351
00:18:53,550 --> 00:18:55,630
He's not the only prince
out there.

352
00:18:56,380 --> 00:18:58,010
I think that's really nice.

353
00:18:58,050 --> 00:18:59,720
[MARI] You're so easily
influenced.

354
00:19:00,220 --> 00:19:01,720
I wonder
when it'll happen to me.

355
00:19:02,430 --> 00:19:04,310
When will I find my prince?

356
00:19:04,350 --> 00:19:06,600
Well, right now you're looking
for fresh clams.

357
00:19:07,270 --> 00:19:08,520
-[MARI] That one?
-Nope.

358
00:19:09,070 --> 00:19:10,480
-This one?
-Perfect.

359
00:19:11,280 --> 00:19:12,320
You're an expert.

360
00:19:14,610 --> 00:19:17,240
Today's been so full
of my favorite things.

361
00:19:17,490 --> 00:19:19,330
We're having okonomiyaki
tonight.

362
00:19:19,370 --> 00:19:21,240
-[LARA] With fish?
-With meat.

363
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:23,700
Oh, I forgot to buy pork.

364
00:19:24,500 --> 00:19:27,080
-I can go and get some.
-Uh...

365
00:19:28,210 --> 00:19:29,920
-[MARI] You sure?
-I've got this.

366
00:19:30,340 --> 00:19:32,250
[MARI] Right. Okay, thanks.

367
00:19:32,300 --> 00:19:33,260
[laughs]

368
00:19:33,460 --> 00:19:35,300
[panting]

369
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:38,470
Thank you. Come back soon.

370
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:53,530
Lady Lara.

371
00:20:00,990 --> 00:20:01,910
Who are you?

372
00:20:03,080 --> 00:20:06,200
It is really good to see you
once again, Lady Lara.

373
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:11,920
We met a very long time ago.
It was at the castle of

374
00:20:11,960 --> 00:20:13,590
the Guardian of the Sea,
Lord Rowan.

375
00:20:13,630 --> 00:20:14,630
[gasps]

376
00:20:16,010 --> 00:20:18,590
Who are you? How do you
know my father's name?

377
00:20:19,930 --> 00:20:20,720
Please tell me.

378
00:20:21,550 --> 00:20:23,010
I go by the name Kota.

379
00:20:24,390 --> 00:20:27,350
I have come here at the behest
of your older sister, Lady Lisa.

380
00:20:30,150 --> 00:20:31,230
Lisa.

381
00:20:32,690 --> 00:20:36,110
Although she isn't here today,
however,

382
00:20:36,780 --> 00:20:38,320
she does want to talk to you.

383
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:40,240
So here she is.

384
00:20:43,490 --> 00:20:44,540
[LISA] Lara.

385
00:20:44,830 --> 00:20:45,700
[gasps]

386
00:20:46,540 --> 00:20:47,500
[LARA] Big sis!

387
00:20:49,210 --> 00:20:51,420
[♪ closing music begins]

388
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:18,170
[♪ closing music ends]

389
00:22:19,630 --> 00:22:20,590
[LARA] Big sis!

390
00:22:21,260 --> 00:22:22,260
Big sis!

391
00:22:22,760 --> 00:22:25,140
[LISA] Lara, I'm so happy
to hear your voice

392
00:22:25,180 --> 00:22:27,390
and to know
that you're back in the world.

393
00:22:28,180 --> 00:22:29,470
[LARA] Where'd you go?

394
00:22:29,770 --> 00:22:31,520
[crying] Home? Father? Everyone?

395
00:22:32,180 --> 00:22:33,560
What happened to you all?

396
00:22:34,310 --> 00:22:35,350
Lara, calm down.

397
00:22:36,440 --> 00:22:38,270
The only ones awake
in this world right now

398
00:22:38,690 --> 00:22:40,610
are you, me,
and Kota over there.

399
00:22:41,690 --> 00:22:43,530
I want to see you, big sis!

400
00:22:44,570 --> 00:22:46,620
I want to see you too,
but not right now.

401
00:22:47,070 --> 00:22:47,990
[LARA] Why not?

402
00:22:48,580 --> 00:22:51,450
[LISA] It's because...
I'm still very far away.

403
00:22:52,870 --> 00:22:55,540
But I have so much I want
to tell you and fill you in on.

404
00:22:57,210 --> 00:23:00,300
So don't worry, I'll definitely
be coming to see you soon.

405
00:23:01,340 --> 00:23:03,260
You're my special princess,
little sis.

406
00:23:03,300 --> 00:23:04,300
Don't forget.

407
00:23:04,550 --> 00:23:06,470
[disconnect tone]

408
00:23:06,510 --> 00:23:07,510
Big sis!

409
00:23:11,970 --> 00:23:13,060
[MARI] Lara!

410
00:23:14,350 --> 00:23:17,690
[LARA] That was definitely
my big sister's voice.

411
00:23:18,900 --> 00:23:21,110
I didn't fully understand it
at the time,

412
00:23:21,780 --> 00:23:24,030
why she hadn't come
to see me in person.

413
00:23:25,150 --> 00:23:27,570
But anyway, that day
was full of happy things.

414
00:23:28,070 --> 00:23:29,780
We had okonomiyaki for dinner.

415
00:23:30,450 --> 00:23:32,330
Mari told me
that she was my friend...

416
00:23:33,330 --> 00:23:36,500
...and my sister.
Big sis was alive!

417
00:23:40,380 --> 00:23:41,710
I have no doubt at all.

418
00:23:42,340 --> 00:23:43,670
That was Lara's voice.

419
00:23:44,550 --> 00:23:46,170
I can't wait to eat.

420
00:23:46,220 --> 00:23:49,350
[LISA] She was definitely
my beloved little sister.

421
00:23:49,390 --> 00:23:50,470
Oh, I can help.

422
00:23:51,350 --> 00:23:52,350
Hold on.

423
00:23:53,520 --> 00:23:54,560
[groans]

424
00:23:54,600 --> 00:23:57,690
[car horn honks]
